      "question": "Consider the following information describing a closed economy with no government: 1. Equilibrium condition is Y=C+I. 2. MPS=0.25. 3. The autonomous part of C is $30. 4. Investment is autonomous and equals $40. At the equilibrium level of national income, consumption expenditure will be _____.",
