      "question": "Consider the following information describing a closed economy with no government: 1. equilibrium condition is Y = C + I 2. MPS = 0.25 3. the autonomous part of C is $30 4. Investment is autonomous and equals $40 Question: At the equilibrium level of national income, consumption expenditure will be Question 40 options: $240. $110. $280. $ 30.",
